# NestJS Backend — Iron Rules

> **Controller → Service → Repository. No exceptions.**

---

## 📁 Module Structure

```
modules/[feature]/
├── [feature].module.ts
├── controllers/     → HTTP handlers only
├── services/        → Business logic only
├── repositories/    → TypeORM only
├── entities/        → Extend BaseEntity
├── dto/             → Validated I/O
└── index.ts         → Barrel exports
```

---

## 🗃️ Entity Template

```typescript
@Entity('table_name')
export class MyEntity extends BaseEntity {
  @Column({ name: 'organization_id', type: 'uuid' })
  organizationId!: string;
  
  @DeleteDateColumn({ name: 'deleted_at', nullable: true })
  deletedAt?: Date;
  
  @Column({ name: 'created_by', type: 'uuid', nullable: true })
  createdBy?: string;
  
  @Column({ name: 'updated_by', type: 'uuid', nullable: true })
  updatedBy?: string;
}
```

---

## 🎯 Layer Rules

| Layer | Does | Never Does |
|-------|------|------------|
| Controller | Parse input, call service, return DTO | Business logic, TypeORM |
| Service | Business logic, validation, orchestration | TypeORM queries |
| Repository | TypeORM queries, pagination | Business decisions |

---

## 🗄️ Repository Pattern

```typescript
// ✅ ALWAYS
async findByOrg(orgId: string, page = 1, limit = 20): Promise<[Entity[], number]> {
  return this.repository.findAndCount({
    where: { organizationId: orgId, deletedAt: IsNull() },
    skip: (page - 1) * limit,
    take: limit,
    order: { createdAt: 'DESC' },
  });
}
```

**Checklist:**
- `deletedAt: IsNull()` — Always filter soft deleted
- `organizationId` — Always filter by org
- `findAndCount` — Always paginate lists
- `createdBy/updatedBy` — Always track mutations

---

## 📝 DTO Pattern

```typescript
export class CreateDto {
  @ApiProperty()
  @IsString()
  @IsNotEmpty()
  @MaxLength(100)
  name!: string;
}

@Exclude()
export class ResponseDto {
  @Expose() id!: string;
  @Expose() name!: string;
}
```

---

## 🔐 Security Checklist

```
✅ JwtAuthGuard on all endpoints
✅ @OrganizationContext() for org isolation
✅ @CurrentUser() for audit trail
✅ class-validator on all DTOs
✅ Never log sensitive data
```

---

## ⚡ Quick Reference

| Action | How |
|--------|-----|
| Get org ID | `@OrganizationContext() orgId: string` |
| Get user | `@CurrentUser() user: CurrentUserType` |
| Response | `toDto(ResponseDto, entity)` |
| Paginated | `toPaginatedResponse(Dto, data, total, page, limit)` |
| Logging | `this.logger.log()` not `console.log` |
